    <bpmn:process id="W_W5201" name="W5201. Developer Bank-Escrow Agreement Review, Onboarding &amp; Credit Setup" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New B2B developer account contract negotiation (VS-11)
Frequency: Continuous per new developer project onboarding
Volume: ~50–60 major developer projects onboarded annually
Owner: B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Participants: Developer Finance Director, Escrow Bank Agent, Legal (VS-100), AR Specialist
Source: workflow W5201 — Developer Bank-Escrow Agreement Review, Onboarding &amp; Credit Setup</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5201_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5201_Lane1" name="B2B Credit Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5201_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5201_Start3" name="New B2B developer account contract negotiation (VS-11)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5201_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5201_Task4" name="Collect and review the tripartite Escrow Agreement / Trust Agreement signed by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Collect and review the tripartite Escrow Agreement / Trust Agreement signed by the Developer, the Funding Bank (Escrow Agent), and the General Contractor.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5201_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5201_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5201_Task5" name="Verify the escrow funding rules: verify payment release triggers, billing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Verify the escrow funding rules: verify payment release triggers, billing documentation checklists, and inspector audit schedules.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5201_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5201_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5201_Task6" name="Set up the Developer Project Account in the ERP credit master; configure credit…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Set up the Developer Project Account in the ERP credit master; configure credit limits and payment terms matching the escrow release windows.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5201_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5201_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5201_Task7" name="Onboard bank escrow contacts and set up secure communication protocols.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Onboard bank escrow contacts and set up secure communication protocols.
Responsible (R): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Accountable (A): B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5201_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5201_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5201_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5201_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-773 (ensure controlled execution — B2B Project Escrow Onboarding, Contract Matching &amp; Credit Setup (PA-181.1).) | - CTL-773: Escrow agreements legal-approved; credit limit setup complies with Board Risk policy.
Owner: B2B Credit Manager / Legal Operations (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
