    <bpmn:process id="W_W5202" name="W5202. Project Purchase Order Matching &amp; Contract Price Alignment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Developer project onboarding (W5201); contract agreement signed
Frequency: Per project onboarding + contract amendments
Volume: ~50–60 contract configurations annually
Owner: B2B Account Manager
Participants: Developer Procurement Manager, Pricing Specialist (VS-01.2), Master Data Team (VS-29)
Source: workflow W5202 — Project Purchase Order Matching &amp; Contract Price Alignment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5202_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5202_Lane1" name="B2B Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5202_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5202_Start3" name="Developer project onboarding (W5201); contract agreement signed">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5202_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5202_Task4" name="Upload the developer&#x27;s Bill of Quantities (BOQ) and contracted unit pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Upload the developer&#x27;s Bill of Quantities (BOQ) and contracted unit pricing sheets into the ERP project pricing master.
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): B2B Account Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5202_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5202_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5202_Task5" name="Configure contract price locks in the system: ensure only the contracted SKUs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Configure contract price locks in the system: ensure only the contracted SKUs can be billed to the project code at the negotiated price.
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): B2B Account Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5202_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5202_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5202_Task6" name="Set up price validation rules: prevent sales clerks from modifying project…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Set up price validation rules: prevent sales clerks from modifying project prices without Category Manager approval (W1394).
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): B2B Account Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5202_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5202_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5202_Task7" name="Match developer&#x27;s corporate PO to the BuildRight contract code; verify SKU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Match developer&#x27;s corporate PO to the BuildRight contract code; verify SKU codes match.
Responsible (R): B2B Account Manager
Accountable (A): B2B Account Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5202_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5202_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5202_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5202_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-773 (ensure controlled execution — B2B Project Escrow Onboarding, Contract Matching &amp; Credit Setup (PA-181.1).) | - CTL-773: Contract prices verified by Category Manager; system blocks billing price changes.
Owner: B2B Account Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
