        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-773 (ensure controlled execution — B2B Project Escrow Onboarding, Contract Matching &amp; Credit Setup (PA-181.1).) | - CTL-773: Project staging allocation approved by Inventory Controller; inventory locks tagged with project codes.
Owner: Supply Chain Planner / Project Coordinator</bpmn:text>
