    <bpmn:process id="W_W5204" name="W5204. Bank Escrow Financing Trust Account System Mapping" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Tripartite escrow agreement onboarded (W5201)
Frequency: Per project setup
Volume: ~50–60 bank mapping setups annually
Owner: Treasury Operations Manager (VS-18)
Participants: Finance Controller, Bank System Administrator
