      <bpmn:userTask id="W5207_Task4" name="Analyze bank&#x27;s escrow portal API endpoints and security protocols (sFTP, HTTPS).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analyze bank&#x27;s escrow portal API endpoints and security protocols (sFTP, HTTPS).
Responsible (R): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Accountable (A): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5207_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5207_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5207_Task5" name="Develop secure data interface: automate the secure transfer of billing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Develop secure data interface: automate the secure transfer of billing invoices, delivery receipts, and geodetic site photos directly to the bank&#x27;s portal.
Responsible (R): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Accountable (A): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5207_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5207_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5207_Task6" name="Configure automated email alerts: notify B2B AR team when bank agent uploads…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Configure automated email alerts: notify B2B AR team when bank agent uploads inspector approvals or logs draw declines.
Responsible (R): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Accountable (A): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5207_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5207_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5207_Task7" name="Test system integration: run end-to-end data transfer simulations and secure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Test system integration: run end-to-end data transfer simulations and secure sign-offs.
Responsible (R): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Accountable (A): IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5207_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5207_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5207_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
