        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-773 (ensure controlled execution — B2B Project Escrow Onboarding, Contract Matching &amp; Credit Setup (PA-181.1).) | - CTL-773: IT security audit approval obtained before API integration; data transmission logs reviewed daily.
Owner: IT Integration Lead (VS-113) / Treasury Administrator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
