    <bpmn:process id="W_W5208" name="W5208. Project Onboarding Compliance Check (Anti-Money Laundering &amp; Sanctions)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New developer account contract creation (W5201)
Frequency: Per project onboarding
Volume: ~50–60 compliance checks annually
Owner: Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Participants: B2B Credit Analyst, Legal Operations (VS-100)
Source: workflow W5208 — Project Onboarding Compliance Check (Anti-Money Laundering &amp; Sanctions)</bpmn:documentation>
