      <bpmn:userTask id="W5208_Task4" name="Conduct PEP (Politically Exposed Persons) and sanctions screening on the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Conduct PEP (Politically Exposed Persons) and sanctions screening on the developer corporation, major shareholders, and board directors.
Responsible (R): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Accountable (A): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5208_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5208_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5208_Task5" name="Verify beneficial ownership (KYC): identify and audit owners holding &gt; 10%…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Verify beneficial ownership (KYC): identify and audit owners holding &gt; 10% equity.
Responsible (R): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Accountable (A): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5208_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5208_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5208_Task6" name="Perform source-of-funds check: verify the funding bank&#x27;s license and check for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Perform source-of-funds check: verify the funding bank&#x27;s license and check for any regulatory alerts on the project funding source.
Responsible (R): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Accountable (A): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5208_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5208_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5208_Task7" name="Secure AMLCO clearance; file clean-status report in compliance folder before…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Secure AMLCO clearance; file clean-status report in compliance folder before account activation.
Responsible (R): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Accountable (A): Anti-Money Laundering Compliance Officer (AMLCO) (VS-86)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5208_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
